  "text": {
    "intro": "The members of the model railway society share one loft layout and a deep well of resentment.\nFive modellers are involved. Determine each modeller's shelf, scenery and grievance.\n- **Modeller**: Rosamond, Esperanza, Hendrik, Gilbert and Abiodun.\n- **Shelf** (listed from lower to higher): the bottom shelf, the second shelf, the third shelf, the fourth shelf and the fifth shelf.\n- **Scenery**: a working level crossing, a sheet of static grass, a flocked cutting, a river of resin and a coal staithe.\n- **Grievance**: the timetable, the wiring, somebody else's couplings, a missing screwdriver and the lighting.\nEvery modeller has a different shelf, scenery and grievance, so within each category every item is used exactly once.",
    "clues": [
      "Esperanza complains about somebody else's couplings.",
      "The modeller who builds a coal staithe and the fourth shelf are exactly one shelf apart in shelf order, in one direction or the other.",
      "The modeller who complains about the timetable and the fifth shelf are exactly one shelf apart in shelf order, in one direction or the other.",
      "The fourth shelf falls somewhere between the modeller who builds a river of resin and the modeller who builds a sheet of static grass in shelf order.",
      "Abiodun is exactly one shelf lower than the third shelf, with no shelf in between.",
      "At least one of the following holds, and possibly more than one: (a) The modeller who builds a river of resin stores on the bottom shelf. (b) One of Gilbert and the modeller who builds a coal staithe sits at an odd-numbered shelf and the other at an even-numbered shelf.",
      "Rosamond does not build a working level crossing. One of Abiodun and the modeller who builds a working level crossing sits at an odd-numbered shelf and the other at an even-numbered shelf.",
      "The modeller who complains about a missing screwdriver does not build a sheet of static grass.",
      "The modeller who complains about somebody else's couplings is lower than the modeller who builds a sheet of static grass in shelf order.",
      "The modeller who complains about the wiring is exactly one shelf lower than Abiodun, with no shelf in between."
    ]
  }
